      "content": "yeah i know i should talk to my doc but i cant get an appointment for like two weeks and i am totally exhausted. i've only ever taken like half a pill of the xanax at a time before. it's not like a huge dose or anything. i just feel like it would be fine since they're both just for calming things down... wouldn't they basically do the same thing? like is there even a real risk if i just take a tiny bit?",
